# {{.ProviderShortName}} Provider

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Usage

To use the provider, declare it as a required provider in your Terraform configuration:

```terraform
terraform {
  required_providers {
    marmot = {
      source = "marmotdata/marmot"
    }
  }
}
```

## Authentication

The provider authenticates with a Marmot API key, set through the `api_key`
attribute or the `MARMOT_API_KEY` environment variable. A bearer `token` (or
`MARMOT_TOKEN`) is also supported, and when no credential is provided the
provider falls back to the Marmot CLI credentials from `marmot login`.

